                        "entry_id": "98852fc1-b871-340b-bf7a-9daee173f13b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to start to loom, to appear in the distance"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "625f7184-743f-4ecd-bade-9e6104adff9e",
                                "sense_id": "2a42b123-0184-319b-af21-d135f077e5fe",
                                "text": "Они́ погрузи́лись в тума́н по по́яс, пото́м по ше́ю, а ещё че́рез не́сколько секу́нд впереди́ замая́чила коса́я глы́ба вагоне́тки.",
                                "translation": "They continued going down, the fog enveloping them to their waists, then to their necks, and in another few seconds the lopsided mass of the railcar loomed ahead.",
                                "english": "They continued going down, the fog enveloping them to their waists, then to their necks, and in another few seconds the lopsided mass of the railcar loomed ahead."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
